 "caption": "How do big apps ship new code without going down? Blue-green deployment.\n\nRun two identical environments. Blue serves users on v1 while you deploy and test v2 on Green. When it passes, flip the router: every request moves to Green in one switch, with zero downtime. If something breaks, flip back. Blue never stopped, so rollback takes seconds.\n\nThe catch: you pay for double infrastructure while both run, and database changes must work for both versions.\n\nWould you use blue-green or canary for your next release?",
